WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.436
-Another weekend,
another racist outburst

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.704
from our racist president.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:07.173
For more on this, it's time for
"A Closer Look."

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:11.610
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.346
It seems impossible now, but
there was a time not so long ago

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:16.515
when you'd go a whole weekend
without hearing a word

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:17.850
from the president.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.819
That was when we had a president
who actually did stuff.

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:23.122
Obama wasn't tweeting all day
because he was busy reading,

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:25.257
holding meetings, or,
at the very least, working out.

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:26.959
I mean, look at that.

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:28.928
On top of being president,

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.632
he was recording
instructional fitness videos.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.335
That one was called
"Obama-nate Your Abs."

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:36.903
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.406
I mean, remember?
You could just do normal stuff

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:40.807
without your phone
buzzing constantly

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.942
because the president said
something racist and insane.

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.911
It used to be, when you were
in the grocery store,

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.113
and you heard someone say
"son of a bitch,"

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:50.149
it was because they were
out of paper towels.

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.784
Now, it's because they
looked down at their phone,

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:53.452
and saw the president
scream-tweet something

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:55.454
in all caps, like,
"The bust of Abraham Lincoln

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.090
is spying on me.
Not nice!"

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.758
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.460
Trump's malignant narcissism
won't let him go 5 seconds

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.029
without being
the center of attention.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:06.198
All day, every day, there's
Trump, on every TV you pass by,

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:08.400
sweating, red-faced,
fighting with reporters,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.436
doing that thing
where he points at his head

00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:15.074
to show everyone
he knows where his brain is.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.143
[ As Trump ] "The doctors say
it looks like a pumpkin

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:21.080
that got left on the stoop
for too long."

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.581
[ Normal voice ]
This is...

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:23.850
This is our life, now.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.920
Long, long after he leaves
office, his dumb face

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.522
will be burned into
our flat screens

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.357
even when
they're turned off.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.759
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.161
And on top of that, Trump spends
all day searching for ways

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.996
to blame or attack enemies
for literally anything,

00:01:37.996 --> 00:01:39.632
no matter what it is.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.100
For example, on Friday,
he was asked

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.903
if he was planning an extended
stay at his Bedminster resort

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.738
in New Jersey,
and in his response,

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:49.275
he found a way to take
a truly insane swipe at Obama

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.245
over the air-conditioning
in the White House.

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:54.413
-So, I go to Bedminster,
which is a beautiful place,

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:57.049
but it's never a vacation.
It's working.

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.751
-Are you planning a trip
to Bedminster

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:00.920
over an extended
period of time?

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.789
-I hope not,
because I like working.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.591
I'd rather be right here,
you know?

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:08.827
But probably over a short
period of time.

00:02:08.827 --> 00:02:10.797
A lot of times,
you go,

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:13.065
and they do a lot of work
in the White House.

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:16.635
For instance, the Obama
administration worked out

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:19.738
a brand-new air-conditioning
system for the West Wing.

00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:23.242
And it was so good
before they did the system.

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:28.147
Now that they did the system,
it's freezing or hot in here.

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:30.816
-Well, maybe it's hot
because you're president,

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:32.118
and this is Hell.

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:35.021
And maybe it's freezing because,
when you were elected,

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.789
Hell froze over.

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:37.923
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:41.694
Trump has been...

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:42.962
losing his mind,

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:45.464
in part over the various
Congressional investigations

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:46.699
into his corruption,

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.468
because he's a fundamentally
lawless president.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:51.170
And one of the Democrats charged
with investigating Trump

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.939
in Congress is Maryland
Congressman Elijah Cummings.

00:02:53.939 --> 00:02:56.008
He's the chair of
the House Oversight Committee,

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:57.777
so it's literally his job

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.345
to conduct oversight
of the administration.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:02.015
For example, Cummings has
criticized and held hearings

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:03.782
on the cruel
and inhumane conditions

00:03:03.782 --> 00:03:05.151
in border
detention centers,

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:08.087
which even Trump's own
Department of Homeland Security

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:10.456
called "dangerous" in a report
released earlier this month.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.157
And Cummings has also
been investigating

00:03:12.157 --> 00:03:14.593
the use of private accounts
to conduct official business

00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:16.528
by some of Trumps' closest
aides and advisers.

00:03:16.528 --> 00:03:18.931
Cummings is doing his job
by investigating Trump,

00:03:18.931 --> 00:03:20.799
and trying to hold this
administration accountable.

00:03:20.799 --> 00:03:23.202
So, naturally, Trump responded
the only way he's capable of --

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:25.137
with a vile,
racist tirade.

00:03:25.137 --> 00:03:27.440
-President Trump picked
another Twitter fight

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.075
with an African American
lawmaker,

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:31.143
calling representative
Elijah Cummings

00:03:31.143 --> 00:03:34.213
a "brutal bully" for
"shouting and screaming"

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:36.883
at Trump officials
testifying before Congress.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:39.351
"The border is clean,
efficient, and well-run,

00:03:39.351 --> 00:03:42.221
just very crowded,"
Mr. Trump tweeted

00:03:42.221 --> 00:03:45.057
before disparaging Cummings'
West Baltimore district

00:03:45.057 --> 00:03:48.928
as a "disgusting,
rat and rodent infested mess."

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.297
-So, once again, he attacked
a Congressmember of color

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:54.033
by using the word "infested,"
just as he did two weeks ago

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.302
when he told four Democratic
Congresswoman of color --

00:03:56.302 --> 00:03:58.638
three of whom were born here,
and all of whom are Americans --

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:00.505
to go back to the
"crime-infested" places

00:04:00.505 --> 00:04:02.007
from which they came.

00:04:02.007 --> 00:04:04.677
Hey, man, the only thing that's
infested, here, is your brain.

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.412
You know, that one.

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:07.713
Yeah.

00:04:07.713 --> 00:04:09.949
I mean, I'd ask...

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.117
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:14.720
I'd ask you to apologize
to these lawmakers

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.121
for your racist tirades,

00:04:16.121 --> 00:04:19.425
but you can't even
say the word "lawmakers."

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:23.028
-He has worked in
both houses of Congress,

00:04:23.028 --> 00:04:25.464
advising lawmarkers.

00:04:25.464 --> 00:04:26.599
-That's right.

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:27.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:30.036
Lawmarkers --
as in, "I think Trump

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:32.205
has been sniffing
lawmarkers."

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:33.673
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:35.440
He keeps coming back to
this racist trope

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.442
because he's a racist.

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:38.043
It's the core of
his ideology.

00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:40.446
On Fox News Sunday,
Trump's acting chief of staff,

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.381
Mick Mulvaney,
tried to defend the tweets,

00:04:42.381 --> 00:04:44.651
absurdly claiming they had
nothing to do with race.

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:46.686
But host Chris Wallace
wasn't having it.

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:49.655
-These is a clear pattern,
here, Mick.

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:53.526
The fact is that,
before his inauguration,

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.627
the president tweeted
about John Lewis,

00:04:55.627 --> 00:04:57.763
a Black Congressman --

00:04:57.763 --> 00:04:59.464
this is before
his inauguration --

00:04:59.464 --> 00:05:02.534
he should spend time in
his crime-infested district.

00:05:02.534 --> 00:05:04.937
Then, two weeks ago,
he goes after

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:06.438
the four members of
"The Squad" --

00:05:06.438 --> 00:05:08.307
all women of color --
and says they should go back

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:12.378
to the "crime-infested countries
from which they come."

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:15.848
Then, he talks about
Elijah Cummings,

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:20.853
and he says his district is
"rat and rodent infested."

00:05:20.853 --> 00:05:21.987
"Infested."

00:05:21.987 --> 00:05:24.990
It sounds like "vermin."
It sounds subhuman.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:28.293
And these are all six --

00:05:28.293 --> 00:05:30.729
members of Congress
who are people of color.

00:05:30.729 --> 00:05:32.598
-I think you're spending
way too much time

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:33.932
reading between the lines.

00:05:33.932 --> 00:05:35.167
-I'm not reading
between the lines.

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:36.669
I'm reading the lines.

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:39.572
-Yeah.
He's just reading the lines.

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.507
It's obvious.

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:44.243
It's not like you need to
play clips of him backwards,

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:47.379
like a Beatles record, to hear
some sort of secret message

00:05:47.379 --> 00:05:48.447
admitting he's a racist.

00:05:48.447 --> 00:05:51.383
Although, I wonder,
if we tried it...

00:05:51.383 --> 00:05:54.020
-I'm a racist.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.488
[ Laughter ]

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:59.225
-The only remedy for a corrupt,
racist president is impeachment.

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:01.594
Congress needs to use
their Constitutional power

00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:03.763
to tell a coherent story
about this president's racism,

00:06:03.763 --> 00:06:05.331
his corruption,
and his self-dealings.

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:07.133
Congress needs to
do their job as...

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:08.568
-Lawmarkers.

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:11.170
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:15.041
[ Cheers and applause ]

